<div class="sans-serif">
  <h3>We can represent the logo with the following commands</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>- Size the <span class="monospace">viewBox</span> to span from <span class="monospace">(-1.0,&nbsp;-1.0)</span> to <span class="monospace">(1.0,&nbsp;1.0)</span>, that is <span class="monospace">viewBox="-1 -1 2 2"</span></li>
    <li>- Imagine a virtual starting point at <span class="monospace">(1.0,&nbsp;-0.707)</span></li>
    <li>- Move to <span class="monospace">60%</span> of that point</li>
    <li>- Draw an absolute line to <span class="monospace">(0.0,&nbsp;0.0)</span></li>
    <li>- Draw a relative line to <span class="monospace">(-1.0,&nbsp;-0.707)</span></li>
    <li>- Draw a relative line to <span class="monospace">(1.0,&nbsp;-0.707)</span></li>
    <li>- <i lang="lat">et cet.</i></li>
  </ol>
</div>

